      "designator": "CS27-0",
      "grouping_at_time": "Subpart D \u2014 Design And Construction",
      "title_at_revision": "Bearing factors",
      "text": "(a) Except as provided in sub-paragraph (b), each part that has clearance (free fit), and that is subject to pounding or vibration, must have a bearing factor large enough to provide for the effects of normal relative motion.\n(b) No bearing factor need be used on a part for which any larger special factor is prescribed.",
